# .claude/ Directory

This directory contains Claude Code configuration for this project.

## Structure

```
.claude/
├── settings.json        # Claude behavior settings
├── keybindings.json     # Keyboard shortcuts
├── hooks/               # Pre/post-execution hooks
│   ├── scout-block/     # Security: block sensitive files
│   └── format-check/    # Quality: validate formatting
├── skills/              # Specialized knowledge modules
│   ├── ios-pro/         # iOS development best practices
│   └── react-typescript/ # React + TS patterns
├── memory/              # Cross-session learnings
│   └── MEMORY.md        # Persistent patterns (<200 lines)
└── CLAUDE.md            # Project context for Claude

```

## Quick Reference

### Settings
- **Model**: Sonnet (configurable in settings.json)
- **Permission Mode**: Ask (auto-approve safe tools)
- **Context Optimization**: Auto-compress enabled

### Hooks
- **scout-block**: Prevents accidental exposure of `.env`, `.pem`, credentials
- **format-check**: Validates formatting (disabled by default, requires prettier/swiftformat)

### Skills
Skills are automatically loaded when relevant to the task. See individual skill README files for details.

### Memory
Edit `memory/MEMORY.md` to add:
- Confirmed project patterns
- Common issues and solutions
- User workflow preferences

Keeps context between sessions.

## Customization

1. **Change model**: Edit `settings.json` → `"model": "opus"` or `"haiku"`
2. **Add keybinding**: Edit `keybindings.json`
3. **Enable format hook**: Edit `hooks/format-check/config.json` → `"enabled": true`
4. **Add skill**: Create new directory in `skills/` with `README.md`

## Learn More

- [Claude Code Documentation](https://docs.anthropic.com/claude/docs/claude-code)
- [Skills Guide](https://docs.anthropic.com/claude/docs/skills)
- [Hooks Reference](https://docs.anthropic.com/claude/docs/hooks)

EOF

